      "worked": "The given ratios require $a\\ne0$ and $b\\ne0$. Cross-multiplying gives $ac=b^2$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta&=b^2-4ac\\\\\\Delta&=b^2-4b^2\\\\\\Delta&=-3b^2<0.\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince $\\Delta<0$, the quadratic has no real solutions.",
